  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If you create a binary and then try to quickly create a version of a binary and then its metadata (or vice versa) you receive a 409 Conflict on the second request.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I have included a bash script to recreate the issue.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The problem is that ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/services/VersionServiceImpl.java#L374"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "this function",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " finds the path or perhaps the node is locked?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
